  "self_load_only": true,
  "description": "bigville R41 (block 332000): NUTRITION (density, variety, deficiency) + TASTE/SPICE + ALE (body & mind). A Food{kind,energy,protein,alcohol,taste} codebook. nu_eat: energy += F.energy*(1-monotony) (DENSITY x VARIETY); protein_store += F.protein; intoxication += F.alcohol; monotony rises if repeat (specific satiety); meal_pleasure = F.taste (+spice_bonus if the meal is spiced AND spice_stock>=1, consuming one spice unit) -- TASTE is what spice is FOR. nu_metabolize: protein/intoxication/monotony/meal_pleasure decay. nu_deficiency: protein_store<need -> deficiency accrues. nu_psych: mood = base + intoxication*gain + meal_pleasure*pleasure_gain - deficiency*pen; focus = base - intoxication*pen - deficiency*pen. Ale lifts mood + impairs focus; deficiency drags both; SPICE buys enjoyment (mood) and rescues a MONOTONOUS diet (its pleasure is decoupled from the energy-monotony -- boring food, spiced, is still a joy). Spice from the exotic market trader is now FOR something.",
